dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-44dded103d55f29ebfe9","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-b1ca2b95c1a4aed6d951","layer":"original","quote":"先主东征吴，习为领军，统诸军；大败于猇亭","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":347,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-62e9da9582533b19ce51","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-e7333fcabcbf1943b561","layer":"pei","quote":"蜀将军傅佥：前在关城，身拒官军，致死不顾；佥父肜，复为刘备战亡。天下之善一也，岂由彼此以为异！佥息著、募，后没入奚官，免为庶人","attribution":"裴注·蜀记","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-549087e33d923b217398","start":15,"end":78,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-67e4f9b2b1bed056a47b","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-ae37311a660d50a1ec42","layer":"original","quote":"或告之曰：“后追已至！解船轻去，乃可以免。”畿曰：“吾在军，未曾为敌走〖10〗；况从天子而见危哉！”追人遂及畿船，畿身执戟战，敌船有覆者。众大至，共击之，乃死","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":331,"end":410,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-7b18684e8ffd04292b00","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-4445e3e3e8a98a07754c","layer":"original","quote":"领兵从先主征吴，与习俱死","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":348,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":15,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q-ef6e93679179b6c18260","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-48db56fffb91683be546","layer":"original","quote":"随先主征吴，军败于秭归，遇害","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":320,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":49,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dengzhang-q2-800d86a330c8ae293ffe","section":"chapter-045","block":"b-e7333fcabcbf1943b561","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《蜀记》载晋武帝诏曰：“蜀将军傅佥：前在关城，身拒官军，致死不顾；佥父肜，复为刘备战亡。天下之善一也，岂由彼此以为异！佥息著、募，后没入奚官，免为庶人。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"邓张宗杨传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0096.xhtml","index":354,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-549087e33d923b217398","start":0,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongliu-q-25211585ffcc2365b464","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-7239366a53921085f610","layer":"original","quote":"良亦遇害","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":61,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"dongliu-q-c0644cd45cb4f702516d","section":"chapter-039","block":"b-7239366a53921085f610","layer":"original","quote":"会先主败绩于夷陵","section_title":"董刘马陈董吕传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0084.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":52,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-1cb5e0273ed0af39abc6","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-6f5d0f2c904adccd1410","layer":"original","quote":"先主东征，败绩猇亭","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":126,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":9,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huangli-q-f120862d5699e9b578c9","section":"chapter-043","block":"b-0996c97d882e13e06732","layer":"original","quote":"及吴将军陆议乘流断围〖5〗，南军败绩，先主引退","section_title":"黄李吕马王张传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0092.xhtml","index":13,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-7c6eeec51538912b9b6d","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-e690691aa6a425fbd55b","layer":"original","quote":"秭归之败〖11〗，宠营特完","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":13,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o017a-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-ae072ca443ff6153c66c","layer":"original","quote":"备从巫峡、建平，连围至夷陵界〖6〗，立数十屯；以金锦爵赏诱动诸夷。使将军冯习为大督，张南为前部，辅匡、赵融、廖淳、傅肜等各为别督〖7〗；","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":68,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-e-o021b-q","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-485f5750e7c476ae4cfe","layer":"original","quote":"乃敕各持一把茅，以火攻拔之。一尔势成〖15〗，通率诸军同时俱攻；斩张南、冯习及胡王沙摩柯等首〖16〗，破其四十余营。备将杜路、刘宁等，穷逼请降。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":90,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":34,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"luxun-q-o017","section":"chapter-058","block":"b-ae072ca443ff6153c66c","layer":"original","quote":"备从巫峡、建平，连围至夷陵界〖6〗，立数十屯；以金锦爵赏诱动诸夷。使将军冯习为大督，张南为前部，辅匡、赵融、廖淳、傅肜等各为别督〖7〗；先遣吴班将数千人于平地立营，欲以挑战。","section_title":"陆逊传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0123.xhtml","index":86,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":87,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o032a-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-4189701a92b124deb712","layer":"original","quote":"闰月〖26〗，孙权破刘备于夷陵〖27〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":285,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-e-o033b-q","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-a5bf91c6f666aa87700c","layer":"original","quote":"八月，蜀大将黄权率众降〖2〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":320,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuzhu-e-o055a-q","section":"chapter-047","block":"b-59fa99f2e0e3c37653aa","layer":"original","quote":"蜀军分据险地，前后五十余营；逊随轻重，以兵应拒。自正月至闰月〖4〗，大破之，临阵所斩及投兵降首数万人〖5〗；刘备奔走，仅以身免。﹝一﹞","section_title":"吴主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0101_split_000.xhtml","index":294,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o069b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-5398e8ba8cc35262f80d","layer":"original","quote":"后十余日，陆议大破先主军于犹亭；将军冯习、张南等皆没〖12〗。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":402,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-e2b85eacbc16310809ee","layer":"modern","quote":"〖7〗二年：章武二年（公元 222）。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":413,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-18295fa1c5ff11c612db","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o068","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-8136daaf302c35b9c188","layer":"original","quote":"二年春正月〖7〗，先主军还秭归；将军吴班、陈式水军屯夷陵，夹江东西岸〖8〗。二月，先主自秭归率诸将进军，缘山截岭，于夷道猇亭﹝二﹞驻营〖9〗。自佷山﹝三﹞通武陵〖10〗，遣侍中马良安慰五溪蛮夷〖11〗，咸相率响应。镇北将军黄权督江北诸军，与吴军相拒于夷陵道。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-0f64e349b7617004ae8b","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-573074f8b77bb485b3b8","layer":"original","quote":"黄武元年，刘备举兵攻宜都；然督五千人，与陆逊并力拒备","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhulv-q-91f98b8cef7e20d317da","section":"chapter-056","block":"b-573074f8b77bb485b3b8","layer":"original","quote":"然别攻破备前锋，断其后道：备遂破走","section_title":"朱治朱然吕范朱桓传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0119.xhtml","index":57,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-9d9cb181df7b17ae9deb","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-7798609de1816f91666c","layer":"original","quote":"与陆逊共拒刘备，备军众甚盛，弥山盈谷。桓投刀奋命，与逊戮力，备遂败走","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":29,"end":63,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-a9b2efcfa5afd7f77f4c","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-b64d8aec66ed57f089fa","layer":"original","quote":"备逾山越险，仅乃得免，忿恚叹曰：“吾昔初至京城，桓尚小儿；而今迫孤，乃至此也","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":222,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":38,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-fd7d20b4b4223a4457f7","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-7798609de1816f91666c","layer":"original","quote":"桓斩上（兜）〔夔〕道〖2〗，截其径要","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":221,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":64,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
